MIMIC-IV Data Notice:

This project is designed to work with MIMIC-IV data from PhysioNet. MIMIC-IV
is a freely accessible critical care database. To access MIMIC-IV, you must:

1. Be a credentialed user on PhysioNet
2. Complete required training (CITI Data or Specimens Only Research)
3. Sign the data use agreement

For more information, visit: https://physionet.org/content/mimiciv/

This repository does not contain any MIMIC-IV data. The data directory is
gitignored and users must obtain the data directly from PhysioNet.
